

RESPONSIVE CHART AND DATA PROVIDER NOTICE
-----------------------------------------
The application includes responsive portrait/landscape chart controls and
technical-analysis presentation sourced from third-party public/provider feeds.
TradingView names, widgets, symbols, exchange data, news, and market data remain
subject to their respective terms and licenses. The project does not represent
that every provider supplies zero-delay or licensed tick data for every asset.

The premium bull/bear launcher artwork is project branding for Mazkiplay Trade.
It is not an official logo or endorsement of any broker, exchange, data provider,
or financial institution.
